# --- STM32CubeIDE / Eclipse project metadata (per-machine, not project state) ---
# Regenerated by opening M4-4205D_Control.ioc in STM32CubeIDE. Build settings that
# regeneration does NOT restore are recorded in HANDOFF.md.
# M4-4205D_Control.ioc and .mxproject stay tracked -- the first is the MCU
# configuration itself, the second is what CubeMX needs to regenerate correctly.
/.settings/
/.cproject
/.project

